  "question": {
    "text": "Of the three independent events&nbsp;<math> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>E</mtext> <mn>1</mn> </msub> </mrow> </math>, <math> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>E</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msub> </mrow> </math> and <math> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>E</mtext> <mn>3</mn> </msub> </mrow> </math>, the probability that only <math> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>E</mtext> <mn>1</mn> </msub> </mrow> </math> occurs is <math> <mrow> <mi>&#945;</mi> </mrow> </math>, only <math> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>E</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msub> </mrow> </math> occurs is <math> <mrow> <mi>&#946;</mi> </mrow> </math> and only &nbsp;<math><mrow><msub><mtext>E</mtext> <mn>3</mn> </msub> </mrow> </math> occurs is <math> <mrow> <mi>&#947;</mi> </mrow> </math>. Let the probability <math> <mrow> <mi>p</mi> </mrow> </math> that none of events <math> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>E</mtext> <mn>1</mn> </msub> </mrow> </math>, <math> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>E</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msub> </mrow> </math> or <math> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>E</mtext> <mn>3</mn> </msub> </mrow> </math> occurs satisfy the equations <math> <mrow> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mi>&#945;</mi> <mo>-</mo> <mn>2</mn> <mi>&#946;</mi> </mrow> </mfenced> <mo>p</mo> <mo>=</mo> <mi>&#945;</mi> <mi>&#946;</mi> </mrow> </math> and <math> <mrow> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mi>&#946;</mi> <mo>-</mo> <mn>3</mn> <mi>&#947;</mi> </mrow> </mfenced> <mo>p</mo> <mo>&#160;=&#160;</mo> <mn>2</mn> <mi>&#946;</mi> <mi>&#947;</mi> </mrow> </math>. All the given probabilities are assumed to lie in the interval <math> <mrow> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mtext>0, 1</mtext> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> </math>.<br />Then &nbsp;&nbsp;<math><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msub><mtext>Probability of occurrence of E</mtext> <mn>1</mn> </msub> </mrow> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>Probability of occurrence of E</mtext> <mn>3</mn> </msub> </mrow> </mfrac><mo>=</mo> </mrow> </math> ​",
